  {
   "id": "f161777c95110",
   "why": "key is L.M. Singhvi - Gram Sabha as direct democracy (84:0:9.3), but option A 'Thungon Committee - Constitutional recognition' is also correct: the Thungon Committee (1988) recommended constitutional recognition of PRIs (notes addition +3), so two options are right."
